# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# setup: apphelp
# An application names its own page at start, and the system menu carries
# a Help row while one of its windows is in front.  This is the hosted
# half: the same descriptor runs out of process in remoteapp.script.
wait 15
note the work window covers it: put that away first
key w ctrl
wait 4
write /tmp/trk_home/.config/TrackerSettings GlobalMenuBar on
wait 20
click-window Descriptor Demo
wait 6
expect-title Descriptor Demo
click 20 8
wait 4
expect-menu About this system…|Help…|
note the page the demo named, opened in the desktop's own reader
menu-pick Help…
wait 15
expect-title Help
expect-narrate Descriptor Demo
expect-narrate What the window shows
note and the reader itself is a window of the desktop's own, so with it
note in front the row is gone: the page was the application's
click 20 8
wait 4
expect-menu About this system…||Find…|Preferences…||Take Screenshot||Shut down…|
key Escape
wait 4
click-window Help
wait 4
key w ctrl
wait 8
expect-no-title Help
